OL,3,AWhat a US diesel export ban could mean
OL,4,Afor you
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,Fwould back a ban on diesel producers
OL,8,Fselling overseas as surging fuel prices
OL,9,Fhit drivers ahead of the midterm
OL,10,Felections.
OL,12,FDiesel prices are hovering near a
OL,13,Frecord $6.45 per gallon on average,
OL,14,Faccording to the American Automobile
OL,15,FAssociation (AAA), due to the ongoing
OL,16,FUS-Israel war with Iran and tight
OL,17,Fglobal supplies.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
