OL,3,AWhat a US diesel export ban could mean
OL,4,Afor you
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump and his backers say a US diesel
OL,7,Fexport ban would protect domestic
OL,8,Fconsumers from those rising costs, but
OL,9,Fexperts say it could trigger major
OL,10,Feconomic waves both at home and across
OL,11,Fthe world if it were to happen.
OL,13,FThe US is one of the world's leading
OL,14,Fenergy producers, with domestic
OL,15,Frefineries churning out roughly four to
OL,16,Ffive million barrels of diesel every
OL,17,Fday, according to the US Energy
OL,18,FInformation Administration (EIA).
